WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.700
The Legendary Number is Alito's Memories.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:09.280
And this Chaos Over-Hundred Number is Don Thousand's curse.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.540
Can it be? Is that how it is?

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.900
Yuma, I've found it! A way to lift Alito's curse!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.400
Are you sure, Astral?

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.400
We can break Don Thousand's curse on Alito?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.640
As Don Thousand said...

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.920
As the Legendary Numbers are unsealed,

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:33.360
His powers will be freed from their shackles and rise again.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:39.760
Our visit to their ruins may very well have been the same thing as helping him.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.980
I...guess so, huh.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.340
Jeez, how retarded could my dad be?!

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.300
I disagree.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:52.700
Until now, he has predicted countless events that were to happen.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.660
It's hard to believe that a man like that would make the situation unfavorable for us.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.620
Isn't it possible, that your father...

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:09.320
predicted that we would fight to free the seven Barian Lords?

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:16.780
If so, then what if the Legendary Numbers have the power to break Don Thousand's spell?

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.000
The Legendary Numbers...

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.900
The Over Hundred Numbers are Don Thousand's accursed cards.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:29.770
The Legendary Numbers are the very memories of the Barian Lords' lives as humans.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.440
These two groups are surely objects that oppose each other.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.920
So...Oh, I get it!
 Then if we beat Alito's Caestus with our Lion Heart...

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.900
Alito's curse will be lifted, right?

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.540
All right. Lets do this!

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.080
Hold on, Yuma.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.820
We don't have enough monsters to summon Lion Heart.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.720
Also, we have zero cards in our hand.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:59.020
Got it. Everything's riding on this last draw.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.460
And with that... Hang in there Kotori!

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.440
We'll save you in no time flat!

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:05.980
Yuma...

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.420
Alright! Hurry up!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.260
Free me and Alito from this stupid spell!

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.900
Sure! Leave it to me! I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:21.820
My turn! Draw!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.760
My feelings came through, Alito!

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:29.840
What?!

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.240
I'll summon Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:42.480
I Overlay my Level 1 Rainbow Kuriboh, Kurivolt, and Darklon!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.980
I build an Overlay Network with 3 Monsters!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.500
Xyz Summon!

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.770
Come forth, Number 54!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.200
The Defiant Gladiator, Lion Heart!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.640
That Number!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.660
<i>Alito! Alito! Alito!</i>

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.880
Wha-What's going on?!

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:12.390
{marker}

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:16.570
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:21.810
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.500
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.680
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:44.500
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.480
the feelings I want to express.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:57.500
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.750
Right now, with you

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.680
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:11.760
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:16.860
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:22.290
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:27.460
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:37.040
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.680
Alito, how come you're so strong?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:52.560
<i>Fists of Awakening! Time for Alito's Revival!</i>

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.350
Tell us, Huh, huh? - Hey Alito!

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:53.680
I told ya, didn't I?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.360
It's 'cause you guys are there for me!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.570
I wanna become just like you, Alito!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.530
Alito-<i>sama</i>...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.200
<i>Please</i> beware.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:08.870
Who are you?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.330
Your life is being threatened.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.750
What? My life?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.080
The Emperor envies your popularity.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.460
Impossible! The Emperor is my most trusted friend!

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.510
Is that so? We shall see...

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.010
Hey! Wait!

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.270
It's absurd.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.810
The Emperor wishes to take my life?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.860
It's not possible.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.360
Number, please protect me as you always have.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:45.950
This is...

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.160
What are you doing?! How dare you?!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:55.910
Alito,

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.170
for the crime of murder, you are to be put on trial.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.590
WHAT?!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.930
There must be a mistake! Let me go! Release me!!!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.510
Murderer! - Criminal Scum!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.470
Deceiver! Base Coward!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.480
Liar!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:23.690
Coward!! - Liar!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.610
<i>This</i> is your accursed past.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.990
Betrayed by your best friend,...

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.000
you came to hate the world and its people...

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.960
... full of hatred and resentment...

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.960
... you finally died... !

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.920
<i>That's right. Nobody! Not a single person believed in me!</i>

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:48.470
<i>Even you, who I called my friend, betrayed me!</i>

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:53.100
<i>Damn...Curse you! DAMN YOU TO HELL!!!</i>

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:58.770
<i>One day I'll rise again! And to this world, I'll bring destruction!</i>

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.230
That...Just now...

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.230
Alito's memories of when he was human?

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.700
Lion Heart and Caestus...resonated?!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.200
Just as a thought. When these two clash, something shall happen!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.170
Don Thousand!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.170
Alito, I'll break you free from that curse!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.710
Lion Heart! Attack Caestus!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.590
And now, I'll use Lion Heart's effect!

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.140
This Attack Position card can't be destroyed by battle!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.640
Also, my opponent takes the same amount of Battle Damage as me!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.480
I'll take 3900 Points of Damage!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.820
In other words, You take 3900 Points of Damage too!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.190
I'll activate Rhapsody in Berserk's effect!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:55.280
While this card is Equipped, if I take 1000 or more points of Damage,

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.160
I can halve that Damage...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.250
... and destroy this card!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:11.420
Yuma!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.880
Lion Heart's effect activates!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:18.140
When your Life Points would become 0, I can use one Overlay Unit

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:21.730
and make our Life Points 100!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.600
Rescue Shock!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.190
Yuma!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.950
0 Life Points...

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.450
... sure pack one hell of a punch.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.370
It can't be!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.080
My curse!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:45.920
Don Thousand!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.420
Did we do it?

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:57.010
I- I... What have I-

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.640
I was...under Don Thousand's...

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.110
Alito! You were being controlled by Don Thousand!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:10.730
Yuma.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.610
I see...

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.280
I was...

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.240
You guys...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.410
saved me from his...

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.960
Alito! The curse has been lifted, right?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.170
Stop! Yuma!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.670
Why? What's wrong, Alito?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.510
Our battle isn't over yet!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.390
I'm Alito, one of the Barian Lords!

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.810
But, your curse is-!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.690
You're right. I was under Don Thousand's control.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.070
But you saw it too! You saw my past!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:56.110
With that hatred in my heart, I was reborn as a Barian!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.740
I belong in the Barian World! There's nowhere else for me!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.750
But you guys are trying to destroy that world! We have to end it here!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.160
Alito.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.960
Yuma, Astral. The duels we had...

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:14.460
They were intense, ...red-hot...They were the best!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.380
But those perfect Duels...

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:21.720
Alito!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.270
Here goes! My Turn! Draw!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:30.310
I activate the effect of the Rhapsody in Berserk in my Graveyard!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.150
When this card is destroyed by its own effect and sent to the Graveyard,

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:39.360
I can send one Monster Card in my hand to the Graveyard, and Special Summon it!

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:45.490
Rise again, Number 80! Rhapsody in Berserk!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:54.630
I activate Rank-Up-Magic! Barian's Force!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:02.090
I'll Rank-Up Rhapsody in Berserk and turn it into Chaos!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.220
Go! Chaos Xyz Change!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.270
Come Forth, Chaos Number 80!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:18.990
The melody that calms the soul restores the true realm of the gods!

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:25.700
Stand by me, Riteclad Conquerer! Requiem in Berserk!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:30.330
And I'll use the other effect of Barian's Force!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.790
When I successfully Summon a Chaos Xyz Monster,

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.590
I can absorb my opponent's Overlay Units!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.340
And for each of those absorbed Overlay Units,

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.180
I can decrease the ATK of my opponent's Monster by 300!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:47.260
Lion Heart's Overlay Units are gone!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.640
This is dangerous. Now the effect we used to restore our Life Points is gone!

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:55.230
Here we go! I'll activate the effect of Requiem in Berserk!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.690
Once per turn, by using a Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:04.490
I can Banish all of my opponent's Spell and Trap Cards!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:09.700
Also, I'll use Requiem in Berserk's other effect!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:14.920
Once per turn, by equipping it to a Monster I control,

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.630
I can increase that Monster's ATK by 2000!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:30.430
Why? Why did he increase Caestus' ATK?

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.140
Lion Heart inflicts the Damage you take to its opponent.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.730
At this rate it'll be a draw!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.230
No. The only ones falling are you guys!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:43.570
When a Monster Equipped with Requiem in Berserk attacks,

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.240
the Monster it battles has its effect negated!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.120
What?!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.750
Caestus! Attack Lion Heart!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.460
Yuma! Use our Trap Card!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.960
Have you gone blind?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.920
You two don't have any on your field!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.380
Wrong! We still have one!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:04.630
I'll activate the Trap Card in my Graveyard! Dimension U-Turn!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.630
Huh?!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.300
By Banishing this card from my Graveyard,

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.310
I can Banish one of my Monsters!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.140
I'll Banish Lion Heart!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.730
Does that Trap Card even have a point?!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.690
If that's how you're going to be, I'll Direct Attack!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.160
I'll activate the effect of my Rainbow Kuriboh in the Graveyard!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:31.870
When I receive a Direct Attack, I can Special Summon him!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.290
In that case I'll destroy Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.420
I owe ya one, Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.140
Yuma... I'll end my turn!

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:53.430
I'll activate Dimension U-Turn's other effect!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.520
The Monster that I banished returns to the field at the end of the turn!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.780
We got through that turn somehow, but...

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.190
Astral, what are we going to do?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.820
Even though we broke the curse,

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.820
Alito's been swept up by the hatred from his past!

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.290
It's like he's under a new curse or something!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.830
A new curse?

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.960
The legends painted on the ruin walls...

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.710
In those legends they were noble and pure of heart.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:27.760
In fact, rather than the Barian World,
they should have passed on to the Astral World.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:33.350
Why did souls such as themselves pass on the Barian World, a realm of hatred and resent?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.600
What if... Is it possible their hatred is part of Don Thousand's plan?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.770
What are you mumbling about?

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:45.030
Yuma. We're going to destroy Caestus with Lion Heart.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:48.650
What are you saying?! How we supposed to destroy it with Lion Heart?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.240
And besides, just a whi-

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.700
Even so we're going to do it!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.490
If we do that, we might figure something out!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.830
You're becoming more like me, you know that?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.210
No I'm not.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.880
Not...!? You...!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:07.050
Now. The next turn will decide it all.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:07.920
Right!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.470
My turn! Draw!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.010
This card's-

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.720
Go! Yuma!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:20.190
Got it! I'll equip the Equip Spell, Sacred Garbs of the King to Lion heart!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.110
A Monster equipped with this card

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.690
has its ATK become the same as the Monster it battles!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.610
That's it. Don Thousand tried to

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:35.080
protect the Over Hundred Number from our Legendary Number.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.370
He even went out of his to use a Number that he cursed himself to do it.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.080
In that case, surely...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.720
Go! Yuma! Astral!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.930
Here we go!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:04.100
Lion Heart!
Go rip Caestus a new one!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.570
It can't be? Is he trying to tie with the same ATK?!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.400
Did you already forget?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:17.240
Lion Heart's effect is negated by Requiem in Berserk!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.620
Nope! Even if we don't have Lion Heart's effect,

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.880
we still have the effect of the equipped Sacred Garbs!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.630
And with that we can destroy Caestus!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:32.300
Oh no you don't! I'll activate the effect of Requiem in Reverse!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.430
By sending this Equip Card to the Graveyard, I can prevent Caestus' destruction!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:40.220
I can prevent Caestus' destruction!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:45.980
Now the only one,

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.610
that's being destroyed is your monster!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.030
I'll use the effect of Sacred Garbs of the King!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:55.030
When the equipped monster would be destroyed by battle,

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.700
by sending this card to the Graveyard I can prevent its destruction!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.830
And I'll activate the other effect of the Garbs that we just sent to the Graveyard!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.750
When I prevent destruction by battle on my turn with its effect,

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:13.470
I can swap the ATK of the Monster that was equipped with the opponent's Monster's ATK and attack again!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.220
I-it can't be!

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:20.220
Lion Heart! Attack Caestus once more!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.570
Alito.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.990
For the crime of murder, you are to be put on trial.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.160
That can't be right! This has to be some sort of a mistake!

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.710
Damn it! Let go!
Stay Still!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.120
Stop it!!!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.920
It is impossible that Alito has committed such a horrible sin.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.590
Alito and I may as well be brothers.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.050
Emperor...

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.720
Once I have passed,

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.010
he is the one who shall be Emperor,

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.260
to bravely rule this country.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.020
Now, free Alito at once!

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.810
Don't do anything foolish...

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:07.850
Who is this wretch?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.400
Who is this wretch?
My name is...Don Thousand.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.200
Th-that man!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.320
I am god of the Barians!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.160
I have need of your strength.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:28.460
Your unbreakable soul and endless spirit!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.130
That shall by my sustenance!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:36.210
I cannot allow your strength be taken by the Astral World!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:47.600
And with this your memories have been altered.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:53.770
You are a soldier of sorrow, betrayed by those you believed.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:59.610
With that rage and hatred in your heart, you shall become a Barian and be reborn!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.950
To death with him!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.790
These are my...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.290
My real memories.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.840
Alito. Alito!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.680
Alito, are you alright?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:32.150
Yuma. Astral.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.980
My memories are...

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:37.690
What you saw just now are your true memories.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:43.160
However, those memories were altered, and sowed the seeds of hatred within you.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.790
All so that your soul would pass on to the Barian World.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.660
All this time...I've been puppet to a bunch of lies.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.080
Alito...

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:57.710
I've....done an unforgivable thing to your friends.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.630
No. You were simply being used.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:05.930
When Don Thousand's powers were sealed away in the seven ruins,

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.850
he let loose the last of his strength.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:15.190
And being as terrifyingly cunning as he is, planned his revival.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.230
And I fell right into his trap.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.150
Alito. Lend us your strength.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.200
Help us beat Don Thousand.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.910
Yuma.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:31.500
Even if I've fallen into Don Thousand's trap, I'm sill a warrior of the Seven Lords.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.000
The Seven Lords and us can understand each other, I'm sure of it!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.170
I have no choice but to defeat you.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:45.720
But, there's somebody else who I have to beat up first now.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.770
I'll cooperate. Let's beat Don Thousand!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.220
Alito!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.310
This is a huge step forward.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.980
If the remaining lords have had their pasts altered, we can free them as well.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.490
The sooner we beat Don Thousand the better!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.650
He's inside Vector.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:04.910
What?!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.620
With Vector, just as I thought...

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.830
Where's Vector right now?

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:12.200
If we go to the Barian World, we're sure to find a clue!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.660
Lets go! To he tBarian World!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.590
Alit's come back to his senses?!
We must hurry.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:23.920
We must take the powers of the remaining lords immediately!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.010
Of course. That's just what I was thinking.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.770
I've been waiting!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.020
Merag! Durbe!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.940
Vector! What are you doing here?!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:45.740
See, the thing is, the time's come for us to <i>gather</i> our power as one.

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.490
But our power is already one, is it not?

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:53.080
Gee, you morons don't get it, do you?

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.620
What I'm saying is, I'm going to destroy you two here,

00:21:56.670 --> 00:22:00.420
and take your all of powers, souls and all!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.630
Get it now?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.380
What are you saying?!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:10.220
{marker}

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.270
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.190
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.080
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.300
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:49.220
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:54.560
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:59.390
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.280
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.440
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.820
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.700
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.450
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:21.920
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.040
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.880
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.300
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:43.400
To make the power of the seven lords his own,

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:45.690
in front of Durbe and Merag stands Vector.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.150
Meanwhile, Nasch is chained within darkness.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.360
Can it be? Is this power-

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.820
Run! Merag! Durbe!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.700
You're...Gilag!

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:59.540
Yes. I remember now. Everything that happened.

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:02.120
Next time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.960
Vector's Scorn! The Sundered Seven Lords!

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:08.130
I'll never forgive you...VECTOR!!!
